- I use `fetch`, not `get`, so a transport failure comes back as a value and is ignored. This keeps the verdict the same.
- A request to a host outside the handle's allowlist still traps, per the interface docs. If the bound handle does not allow `metadata.internal.example`, every run of this node will fail.

